    'Brooklyn went all in on the rebuild in 2024, trading Mikal Bridges to the Knicks for four unprotected first-round picks and a swap. That gave the Nets a league-high 15 first-rounders from 2025 to 2031. The cost showed on the court: 26-56 in 2024-25 and a 1-8 start to 2025-26.',
